# Fork (giantswarm/substrate): time-boxed acceptances of image-scan findings
# the line cannot fix itself (the CircleCI pipeline scans every own image; a FIXABLE
# HIGH/CRITICAL finding is never listed here — bump the module, upstream first).
# One finding per line, with an expiry and a reason; an expired entry fails the
# scan again and is re-triaged, never just extended:
#
#   CVE-2026-NNNNN exp:2026-12-31 # <module@version>: why no fix exists upstream, what to track, tracked in <owner>/<repo>#NN
